{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/algebra-basics/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/algebra-basics.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Mathematics - Algebra Basics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"accent-gradient text-white sticky top-0 z-40\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-2 bg-white/20 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"mi -atom\" data-mi=\"atom\">atom</span></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Algebra Basics</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs opacity-80\">Variables, like terms, simplifying and distributive property</div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">Progress: <span id=\"progress\">0%</span></div>\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/\" class=\"text-white/90 hover:text-white text-sm\">Back to Math</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <aside class=\"lg:col-span-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl card-glow sticky top-24\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-3\">Contents</h3>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li><a href=\"#definition\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span>Definition</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#methods\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">2</span>Key Ideas</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#examples\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">3</span>Examples</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#practice\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">4</span>Practice</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <section class=\"lg:col-span-3 space-y-6\">\n        <article id=\"definition\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">What is Algebra?</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Algebra uses letters (variables) to stand for numbers. We learn to work with expressions and simplify them by combining like terms and using rules such as the distributive property.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"methods\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Key Ideas</h2>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: Variables & Like Terms -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"k1\">\n                  <span>1. Variables &amp; Like Terms</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"k1\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Variables</strong> are letters that stand for numbers (e.g., x, y).</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Like terms</strong> have the same variable(s) to the same power. Example: 3x and -2x are like terms; 3x and 3x² are not.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Step: When simplifying, add/subtract only like terms.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: Coefficients & Constants -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"k2\">\n                  <span>2. Coefficients &amp; Constants</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"k2\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">The <strong>coefficient</strong> is the number in front of a variable (3x → 3). A <strong>constant</strong> has no variable (5 is a constant).</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">To combine like terms, add/subtract their coefficients and keep the variable part the same.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: Distributive Property -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"k3\">\n                  <span>3. Distributive Property</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"k3\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">a(b + c) = ab + ac. Multiply the term outside the bracket with each term inside.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Example: 3(x + 4) → 3x + 12.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Tip: Use distributive property to remove brackets before combining like terms.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"examples\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -calculator\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Worked Examples (step-by-step)</h2>\n              <div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-gray-700\">\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 1: Simplify 3x + 5x</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Recognise like terms: 3x and 5x both have x</li>\n                      <li>Add coefficients: 3 + 5 = 8</li>\n                      <li>Answer: 8x</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 2: Simplify 4a - 2a + 7</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Combine like terms (4a - 2a = 2a)</li>\n                      <li>Constants: 7 stays as is</li>\n                      <li>Answer: 2a + 7</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 3: Expand 2(x + 3)</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Distribute: 2·x + 2·3</li>\n                      <li>Simplify: 2x + 6</li>\n                      <li>Answer: 2x + 6</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 4: Simplify 5 + 2x + 3 + x</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Group like terms: (2x + x) and (5 + 3)</li>\n                      <li>2x + x = 3x; 5 + 3 = 8</li>\n                      <li>Answer: 3x + 8</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"practice\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Practice Problems</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Type answers and press Check. Hints available.</p>\n\n              <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">1) Combine like terms</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">3x + 4x</div>\n                  <input id=\"p1\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 7x\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb1\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">2) Distribute</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">2(x + 5)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p2\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 2x+10\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb2\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">3) Combine and simplify</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">4a - 2a + 5</div>\n                  <input id=\"p3\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 2a+5\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb3\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">4) Group then factor</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">ab + 2a + b + 2</div>\n                  <input id=\"p4\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., (a+1)(b+2)\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb4\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t\">\n                <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Independent Practice</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2\">Simplify and show your final answer.</p>\n                <label class=\"block text-sm\">Problem: <code class=\"font-mono\">3(x + 2) + 4x</code></label>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-3\">\n                  <input id=\"ind\" class=\"p-2 border rounded w-60\" placeholder=\"Final answer\">\n                  <button id=\"checkInd\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"fbInd\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                <button id=\"showIndSol\" class=\"text-xs mt-2 text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700\">Show solution</button>\n                <div id=\"indSol\" class=\"mt-3 hidden p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded text-sm\"></div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <button id=\"quizBtn\" class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 z-50 bg-indigo-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"mi -bolt\" data-mi=\"bolt\">bolt</span> Quiz</button>\n\n  <div id=\"quizModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-50 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 relative\">\n      <button id=\"closeQuiz\" class=\"absolute top-3 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 text-2xl\">×</button>\n      <div id=\"quizContent\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 text-sm text-gray-500\">Algebra Basics — interactive lesson</footer>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Algebra Basics | Mathematics</title>\n  \n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style> body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);} </style>\n\n\n  <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Algebraic Foundations</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-lg p-6\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Algebra Basics</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Introduction to variables, expressions, substitution and simplifying algebraic expressions.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Worked example</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Simplify: 3(x+2) - 2x = 3x+6-2x = x+6.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Simplify: 5a - 2a + 3.</li>\n        <li>Evaluate for x=2: 4x^2 - x + 1.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Brief solutions</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>3a + 3.</li>\n        <li>4(4) - 2 + 1 = 15.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-gray-100 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":["@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0 } to { opacity: 1 } }\n    .card-glow { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(99,102,241,0.06); animation: fadeIn 0.45s ease; }\n    .accent-gradient { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#6366f1,#06b6d4); }\n    .step-badge { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.08); color:#3730a3; padding:.25rem .5rem; border-radius:.5rem; font-weight:600; display:inline-block; width:24px; height:24px; text-align:center; font-size:.75rem }\n    .accordion-content { max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition: max-height .28s ease }\n    .accordion-content.open { max-height:900px }","body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":["#definition","#methods","#examples","#practice"]}